      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白多伯体认到自己离“目白家的全新荣耀”\n还很遥远，流露出不甘的心情。\n但她的内心并没有放弃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "546d882dfc9598d63bda0919c6721b998acdb826902b6e661b720e0835659d47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
