      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白多伯不忘心中与目白光明立下的誓言，\n期望在“大阪杯”重新振作，\n重新迈开了步伐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1e5a8c1a2a89f3e5bba04f6c3a1ffcdbb96a28dc9f07813cb47ffe3971ac91c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
