      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自己这样真的称得上\n变得跟气槽一样吗？\n她的心中满满都是焦躁感──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2b24c3dd7091e32bba0632d92eb966f8174ce313e99cc78d0fd4c44c90a8ad",
