    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13f2d2cf7901d02e292582ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大阪杯结束后・折翼",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e35eb36935eb9e1fd1e009a6bc2178f77ba84cfedf2b376b7938bc3da303787",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1059/storytimeline_501059428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc0e5fb27fdc8d9776304db8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明才刚在“天皇赏（春）”获胜，\n却已经看准了接下来的目标，\n目白多伯对她耀眼的模样抱持着接近崇拜的感情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f57573bf7da2da72f2c4028498376c8824166da76b57ab9e7487ce1f5a5b95a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1059/storytimeline_501059429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33844e8c1629c6eac7b8f4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白多伯想要变得跟光明一样。\n一出现这个念头，她这才察觉\n自己老是渴望着成为“别人”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0ea2ad40c2138a4ddfc8620a460efad1de63a0d0b9bc7c64e61cbf293a252ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1059/storytimeline_501059429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c5ecc8876ad9e7dbf018752",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为对自己没有自信，老是追赶着别人。\n但那些真正会发光的人，都是靠自己的力量，\n用自己的做法，下定决心让自己发光的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3525770512cfffca4a41ebe6dd1e908c04e2a9be9b0a32d7cfb0ebcf7594d033",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1059/storytimeline_501059429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653de451c8265aaff58652e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白多伯察觉到这点后，\n为了成为“目白的全新荣耀”，\n她下定决心要面对自己的懦弱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "465a0a5da6ce597b3c877c69f36d59fe695decc3fc1f0cc4558191434e87db89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1059/storytimeline_501059429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edb993cf530fb842fc7344e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别再想着要变成“别人”。一切都是为了\n成为真正强大的“目白多伯”！\n试图振作的她定下“宝冢纪念”这个目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fee0896e53c536c0731b7d1914aebe79e21c679a0c3315e8beac1429e677e5ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1059/storytimeline_501059429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
