      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "错失奖牌的目白光明流露出悔恨之情，\n并誓言会重新振作。从她不屈不挠的态度中，\n目白多伯看见了自己身上没有的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b383669fdf0a8b35653d4efb8b286ed6959bf65a33f31017022ee912352934",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1059/storytimeline_501059430.json",
      "json_path": [
